  "description": "T2 Horse Chestnut (Aesculus hippocastanum), Rear Garden\r\nProposed works:\r\nCrown reduction of approximately 20%, removing up to 2 metres in height and lateral spread\r\nCrown raise by removing lower branches to achieve 5.5 metres clearance from ground level\r\nCurrent dimensions: Approx. 13 metres in height, 8 metres radial spread\r\nFinished dimensions: Approx. 11 metres in height, 6 metres radial spread\r\n\r\nJustification:\r\nTo reduce end-weight on limbs and maintain crown structure\r\nImprove light levels to the garden and neighbouring properties\r\nRaise lower canopy to allow access and provide appropriate clearance\r\n\r\nCompliance: \r\nAll works to be completed in line with BS 3998:2010 – Recommendations for Tree Work, with reductions made to suitable growth points and all arisings removed from site",
